{"orgCode":"8140","name":"State Public Defender","agencyCode":"8000","agencyName":"General Government","description":"The Office of the State Public Defender is a dual mission agency. It provides high quality appellate representation, focusing on those who have been sentenced to death in California. In addition it works to improve public defense across California by providing technical assistance to counties, public defense training, and engaging in related research and education efforts.","totals":{"amounts":{"py":22941,"cy":37778,"by":29006},"positions":{"py":95.6,"cy":98,"by":104}},"programs":{"id":"exp/8000/8140","kind":"department","name":"State Public Defender","code":"8140","amounts":{"py":22941,"cy":37778,"by":29006},"positions":{"py":95.6,"cy":98,"by":104},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":22941,"cy":37778,"by":29006}},"children":[{"id":"exp/8000/8140/6530","kind":"program","name":"State Public Defender","code":"6530","amounts":{"py":22941,"cy":37778,"by":29006},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":22941,"cy":37778,"by":29006}},"positions":{"py":95.6,"cy":98,"by":104},"description":"6530 - Program: 6530\n\nSTATE PUBLIC DEFENDER\n\nThe objective of the Office of the State Public Defender is to provide legal services in capital appeals to persons who do not have the financial means to employ private counsel. The Office of the State Public Defender is also mandated to provide assistance and training to public defender offices, appointed private counsel, and counsel appointed to represent indigent juveniles, and to engage in related efforts for the purpose of improving indigent defense. The State Public Defender is headquartered in Oakland, and has a regional office in Sacramento.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":22941,"cy":22753,"by":24006},"Local Assistance":{"py":0,"cy":15025,"by":5000}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/8000/8140/6530/f0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":22941,"cy":37778,"by":290